{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "15bd92874562f03ac3c66da64229bca9b443a3caf562628d828dcc23df2b1981", "ja": "マンガの……香り？", "zh": "漫画的……气味？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9276ab4eb33eeb3ed7523526c0f5209abbb8234f1f6051fc1da54ff7d3f7f8d9", "ja": "打ち合わせで、翼達がマンガを描いて企画に\n参加しようとしている事を話すと、イベント\nでの公開を提案される。危機感を覚えた3人\nはマンガの香りがする人物こと小鳥に協力を\n頼み、厳しくも的確なアドバイスをもらう。", "zh": "在开会商讨时，提到了翼她们打算画漫画\n参加企划一事，对方提议在活动上公开。\n感到危机感的3人向散发着漫画气息的\n小鸟寻求协助，得到了严格而切中要害的建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "13ff786b93ff1e5a2c8000c6c41d9e8988d9f50e60e58a7b8a9f33a326aff875", "ja": "（今日は、出版社で展示会イベントの打ち合わせ。\n和やかな雰囲気で進み、話題はマンガの事に……）", "zh": "（今天在出版社商谈展览活动的事。\n气氛融洽地进行着，话题转到了漫画上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1001_tantousya", "source_sha256": "af850271e9f66700d3268794d84e7b847c092b659c63dd8e4fb0fac0129ce5fa", "ja": "そういえば765プロさんでも、以前マンガを\n題材にしたお芝居をやってらっしゃいましたよね。", "zh": "说起来，765制作人您之前也演过以漫画为题材的戏，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0a12bb4ca1f5888d48e1711b71b3edc851f712b652c4e6cbea93aaccde9f57ab", "ja": "あ、『紙・心・ペン・心』ですね。\n大学のマンガ研究サークルのお話で……。", "zh": "啊，《纸・心・笔・心》对吧。\n是讲大学漫画研究社团的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "55da8cbfb6ab07a002885bf47b9ae322a1276559fe17eaffffac05e2c00e841b", "ja": "同人誌即売会に向けて、マンガを描くという\n内容なんですが……。実はですね……。", "zh": "内容讲的是面向同人志即卖会画漫画……\n其实呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b99422c1c4b70a2fdc545486d9fdde7f8c17656eb5315e51784fdc91aadf6570", "ja": "今回出演させていただくアイドル達が、マンガを描いて\n『持ち込み編集部』に参加しようとしているんです。", "zh": "这次要出演的偶像们，正准备画漫画参加“投稿编辑部”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1005_tantousya", "source_sha256": "f8177743ed2b8a717f039e0fcd5e36993d9795458a278ecc49ceca4a7de0d3a8", "ja": "え！？\nアイドルのみなさんが、マンガを……？", "zh": "欸！？\n偶像们要……漫画……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1006_tantousya", "source_sha256": "ec982617d20bf85bc79764b1d978d5bf5e436c48fffe7f5ae61d0ba937f945ac", "ja": "そうでしたか……。いや、であれば……。\nそれ、イベントで公開しません？", "zh": "原来如此……既然这样……\n要不要在活动中公开那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1008_tantousya", "source_sha256": "0c34f38ff80ddd5a73400f07a498e7db6e53ff378ab80c4d44b9734f8c76c169", "ja": "イベントのひとつに、『持ち込み作品公開コーナー』\nという企画がありまして……。", "zh": "活动项目中有一个名为“自带作品公开区”的企划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1009_tantousya", "source_sha256": "ee065304cdf52f76961c33d7c6b99b9dd8c15dfa3b2624a9aed544a5f257f788", "ja": "編集者だけでなく、漫画家が直接作品を見て、講評を\nしてくれるんです。よければ、そのコーナーで……。", "zh": "不只是编辑，漫画家还会亲自看作品并进行点评。如果您愿意的话，可以去那个栏目看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "df5f484ed80473129d79bb03a415a4401662faa8f3365bed2711220532f4b084", "ja": "でも、素人ですよ？", "zh": "不过，我可是门外汉哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1011_tantousya", "source_sha256": "a93944d6dcce26d714549b9a87565a48bfb59836211a9128fa8422d9c60a66fd", "ja": "だからいいんですよ。\n大事なのは、作りたいという強い気持ちです。", "zh": "所以才更好。\n重要的是那份想要创造出来的强烈心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1012_tantousya", "source_sha256": "3caef0736f496cc6657ccf6d4147cab87e6450512b31855176bfff7d8d5b8cd0", "ja": "それにアイドルのみなさんが作品を公開してくれれば、\n他の投稿者の心理的負担も下がるかもしれません。", "zh": "而且，如果偶像们愿意公开作品，其他投稿者的心理负担或许也会减轻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bcfef84b850d64ffae2c23db27cb1d965253ca81adf07baed75246d66ecab5f1", "ja": "なるほど……。できれば協力したいところなんですが、\nいったんアイドル達に確認させていただけますか？", "zh": "原来如此……如果可以的话，我也很想帮忙，不过能先让我跟偶像们确认一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1014_tantousya", "source_sha256": "8df7b22b35909e3e27fb721df4676753adc2c37f039a8ff67adde4c2681ff4c8", "ja": "ええ、もちろんです！\nよろしければ、是非！", "zh": "嗯，当然！\n如果方便的话，请一定要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "714214a72acf5ac42e4333aedc7cc919ab06660798156bc050a3f654a5c66c55", "ja": "……と、いう訳だ。みんなのマンガを、\nお客さんの前で取り上げてもらってもいいか？", "zh": "……事情就是这样。可以把大家的漫画拿到客人面前展示吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "039b883f8d7201b700cd9f1adfe3a3ef99ae07a984854299b3105132092fb85a", "ja": "ニャッ！？　{$P$}ちゃん……。\nそれは一歩間違ったら、公開なんちゃらでは？", "zh": "喵！？{$P$}……那要是一不小心，不就变成公开什么的了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6fd08fd4ec7d40c15542ed630d43e36d38f5916ddfd62efe5ddbfc962be6240e", "ja": "そうだな。\n俺もそう思う。", "zh": "是啊。\n我也这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1f828eea8599c737d5374b489e9e875224bdad9ec1204cae4e527eadff79704b", "ja": "え、なんでですか？　そうならないように\nいいカンジに描けばいいんですよー。", "zh": "诶，为什么啊？那就画得恰到好处一点，不让它变成那样不就行了嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "86ecdcc0c8a6ef7c52c7c77c420ed0d980fff32d28f6fc8d29bebc5fb5efe471", "ja": "翼ちゃん……自分たちが失敗するかもしれないなんて、\n微塵も考えてないね！　陽キャはこれだから！", "zh": "翼……你根本一点都没想过自己可能会失败吧！阳光开朗的人就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "6177516fc75b79abf1da3863a170a69aafdf2a6b85ce1f080a635094ab50db1e", "ja": "で、でも……私たち、マンガを描くの、初めてですし。\nお、お客さんにも、見られちゃうってなると……。", "zh": "可、可是……我们还是第一次画漫画。而、而且还要被客人看到的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "39154816343504170d1e773797895e0f5dadf9ec2452af6020b218d7be4f7a37", "ja": "や、やっぱり、誰かに……\nアドバイスとか、もらった方が……。", "zh": "果、果然还是……\n找人要些建议之类的比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "9bd81333cc053d2c0206b3fb4d70c433373c46784b2750d8c9536b17b7567023", "ja": "あ……そうだ。あの、劇場の、か、関係者で……\nひとり、マンガの香りがする人が、いたんです……。", "zh": "啊……对了。那个，在剧场的、相、相关人员里……\n有一个人，身上散发着漫画的气息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3367d9e85b90bc0622f61d156de5e3370d6425d459bde109e5ae06ba11ff2ef9", "ja": "マンガの香り？\n……あ！", "zh": "漫画的气息？\n……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "d66f639f6b4a9fdde01522f359a35cc4951a4574d6bd4d8f59e70ad3028c1a61", "ja": "はーい、呼ばれて参りました、音無小鳥でーす♪\n……あの、今さらなんですけど、私で合ってます？", "zh": "好——我应召而来，我是音无小鸟♪\n……那个，虽然现在才问，不过真的是我没错吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_1026", "source_sha256": "d2fd8babc83c94a027467f1b19f969e0dafc05c8f054f2351255072280ce2b3c", "ja": "合ってます！", "zh": "回答正确！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d1416664651d2565ce432f6c3ce3d9197d5a52af76b2c7fb566d9d32727643ee", "ja": "という訳なんです、音無さん。みんなに、\nアドバイスしてやってもらえませんか？", "zh": "就是这么回事，小鸟小姐。能不能请您给大家提些建议？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "76eb0c06dc37442262facdb513c3d127ba5ccad65b64375e7819798894712d2d", "ja": "そんな。私なんて、ただのマンガ好きな\n一読者でしかありませんけど……いいんですか？", "zh": "怎么会。我也只是一名喜欢漫画的普通读者而已……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2002_023aka", "source_sha256": "3b01207ba503d4a6adbd55b17f164118a9efcc23b75edafef83dfcd7e28cd185", "ja": "その視点が大事なんだよ、小鳥ちゃん！\nお願い、茜ちゃん達を助けて！", "zh": "这个视角很重要啊，小鸟！拜托了，救救小茜他们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2003_045kar", "source_sha256": "b7a2133218e49c4d924e9c3d421c6174acb9ff0539ae42821f1062c7397ed471", "ja": "小鳥さん……。\nわ、私からも……お願いします……！", "zh": "小鸟小姐……。\n我、我也……拜托您了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "90bdf5e35b628272960524a3271a6638860508a4c6682f03ced1265af10cfcd2", "ja": "わたしに、アドバイスくださーい！　ちなみにこれが、\nわたしたちが書いたプロット？ってやつでーす！", "zh": "请给我一些建议吧——！顺便说一下，这个就是我们写的……叫作剧情大纲？的东西——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2005_101kot", "source_sha256": "9a5903758dabb95883d7770eff2de41051a5c2d632f229fe432ac8553584ab92", "ja": "わぁ、もうプロットができてるんですね！\nでは、さっそく拝見しましょうか♪", "zh": "哇，已经写好剧情大纲了呢！\n那么，我们马上来看看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2006_101kot", "source_sha256": "e240fa4271f46744ae84a0091c3e72f14d0f50d1283d9bdb969e02f14d8ad632", "ja": "ふむふむ……。なるほど……。\nそうですね……まず。", "zh": "嗯嗯……原来如此……。\n是啊……首先。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2007_045kar", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
