{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2012_101kot", "source_sha256": "09cdd085754aea291c18f39cb7b92904e3a889b5c51a70ab5d5818da6910676b", "ja": "最後に、お話にお金を絡ませるのは全然ダメ！\n少女マンガなのに、ロマンチックじゃないっ！", "zh": "最后，把钱扯进故事里是绝对不行的！\n明明是少女漫画，一点都不浪漫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2013_023aka", "source_sha256": "e5cd5ed42c874c1ae63d3c08cecfa605085d11c022999c20e60222b267d6c798", "ja": "ごもっともすぎる！", "zh": "你说得太有道理了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
