{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2021_045kar", "source_sha256": "b88543778aeafddb970bd70779c21b07ee2307bcb1b9298bb09017f92c7ba8c2", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nお、お話を作るのって、難しいんですね……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n创作故事，原来这么难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2022_p", "source_sha256": "f21e19e2bd4777c57906eb6edcbddcbbf8c6a08e1831b810b1d2cc94f84c1092", "ja": "そうだな……。難しくて、大変な作業だ。\nどうする？　やめるか？", "zh": "是啊……既困难，又是项辛苦的工作。\n怎么办？要放弃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e225ca0e7676b8328bb688eb5d9c7963fb41cb286b46f7fdecdd68bbe7cfcdd8", "ja": "ええ～っ！　ダメー！\nわたし、絶対諦めないもん！", "zh": "诶诶～！不行——！\n我绝对不会放弃的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2024_023aka", "source_sha256": "474aa8ed325faa38504692f122056e6ca7e32351a22bb25d6160a86a0a931e74", "ja": "そうだよ！　500万円！　絶対に諦めないよ！\nみんな、ブラッシュアップがんばろう！", "zh": "就是啊！500万日元！我绝对不会放弃的！\n大家一起努力完善吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2025_045kar", "source_sha256": "bce808a0e56528fbcecc431a7f3f58b61907058804481ee63777304e45c95e0e", "ja": "う、うん……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2026_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2027_023aka", "source_sha256": "045c7de7e4c6d845dc55097c6a5bee84c19e8316365c76993b9bd83853ced5aa", "ja": "むむ……。お金のエピソードは仕方なくカットする\nとして、主人公のキャラも変えないとかにゃ？", "zh": "唔唔……钱的那段只能忍痛删掉了，主角的性格也别改之类的喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "68842eb115569f904b2d263b62d2dc1065e527e3d99c311e493144c479fa0a4e", "ja": "う～ん……。\nでも、どういう子にすればいいのかなぁ？", "zh": "嗯……  \n可是，要设定成什么样的孩子才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2029_045kar", "source_sha256": "b647cdddbd622dfa363bada357773013acced956ecb38f28e85ff94fe9d9def3", "ja": "も、モテモテじゃなくて、すこし地味な子にして……。\nそんな子が、勇気を出して……い、一歩踏み出す……？", "zh": "不、不是万人迷，而是设定成一个稍微朴素一点的女孩……  \n这样的女孩鼓起勇气……迈、迈出一步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "59454f4ef32029e5a7c2cd754ac3f0c03b90aa3a2c69354e311bb43a3cdcd32c", "ja": "あ～、いいかも～。少女マンガっぽ～い！\n主人公がそういう子なら、相手の子は～……。", "zh": "啊～，感觉不错呢～。好有少女漫画的感觉～！\n主角是那种类型的话，对方就～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2031_p", "source_sha256": "2411bce2288c8a24c4be5bb1b682f1fb1fd6d1232d8e0091f73344c6b8a74d61", "ja": "（みんな、遅くまで頑張ってるな。差し入れも\n買ってきた事だし、そろそろ休憩してもらおう……）", "zh": "（大家都努力到这么晚啊。既然我也买了慰问品，就让她们差不多休息一下吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2032_101kot", "source_sha256": "aa6df75bb0e6abafbe7e728cb6b5f017bc996cf5f90208be09e704d3f085bca9", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん。\nもしかしてそれ、差し入れですか？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生。\n难道说那个是慰劳品吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2033_p", "source_sha256": "a55e623a30c88dea923d87b0df9726fd8c2e6d82c7da9d727a876204fc4e3302", "ja": "音無さん！　ええ、そうですけど……。\nあれ、音無さんが持ってるのも……。", "zh": "音无小姐！嗯，是啊……。咦，音无小姐拿着的也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2034_101kot", "source_sha256": "e5822fc091f38d9cc53de1d6f35dc3760987d580e679a8fb15d42e79c55d8404", "ja": "差し入れです。被っちゃいましたね♪　みんなの\n頑張りを見てたら、私も何かしたくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "是慰劳品。撞上了呢♪看到大家\n那么努力，我也忍不住想做点什么了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2035_101kot", "source_sha256": "56987fd477c282af84ec50c623375eb3801765ca4f4f3cc22ff279cfa239b188", "ja": "……本当に、みんな一生懸命で可愛いですよね。\nうふふっ♪", "zh": "……大家真的很努力，又很可爱呢。\n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2036_p", "source_sha256": "28cad5d589c0a4f8c08807d82f94759a2f2a620462cf4f16e0c23329de05d6d2", "ja": "ええ。そうですね……。", "zh": "嗯，是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_03_2037_p", "source_sha256": "6db4d0047241a48a13a7a603eff7ad23c78122c7b55cd845667072e81e223c28", "ja": "（物を作るという作業は、想像以上に大変だ。\nけど……あの3人なら、乗り越えられるはずだ！）", "zh": "（制作东西这件事，比想象中还要辛苦。不过……那3个人一定能克服的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
